{"slug":"e-j-l","ar":"ع ج ل","total":47,"core":"haste; the immediate; calf","forms":[{"ar":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":19,"gloss":"to seek to hasten","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":204,"p":2,"ar":["أَفَبِعَذَابِنَا","يَسْتَعْجِلُونَ"],"en":"So for Our punishment are they impatient"}},{"ar":"عِجْل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":10,"gloss":"Calf","word":"ijl","ex":{"s":51,"a":26,"p":5,"ar":["فَرَاغَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِهِۦ","فَجَآءَ","بِعِجْلٍ","سَمِينٍ"],"en":"Then he went to his family and came with a fat [roasted] calf"}},{"ar":"عَجِلَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":5,"gloss":"to hasten","word":null,"ex":{"s":75,"a":16,"p":5,"ar":["لَا","تُحَرِّكْ","بِهِۦ","لِسَانَكَ","لِتَعْجَلَ","بِهِۦٓ"],"en":"Move not your tongue with it, [O Muhammad], to hasten with recitation of the Qur'an"}},{"ar":"عَجَّلَ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":5,"gloss":"to hasten","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":16,"p":3,"ar":["وَقَالُوا۟","رَبَّنَا","عَجِّل","لَّنَا","قِطَّنَا","قَبْلَ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْحِسَابِ"],"en":"And they say, \"Our Lord, hasten for us our share [of the punishment] before the Day of Account"}},{"ar":"عَاجِلَةٌ","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"the immediate, fleeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":75,"a":20,"p":4,"ar":["كَلَّا","بَلْ","تُحِبُّونَ","ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ"],"en":"No! But you love the immediate"}},{"ar":"أَعْجَلَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"to make hasten","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":83,"p":2,"ar":["وَمَآ","أَعْجَلَكَ","عَن","قَوْمِكَ","يَـٰمُوسَىٰ"],"en":"[Allah] said, \"And what made you hasten from your people, O Moses"}},{"ar":"عَجَل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"haste","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":37,"p":4,"ar":["خُلِقَ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","مِنْ","عَجَلٍ ۚ","سَأُو۟رِيكُمْ","ءَايَـٰتِى","فَلَا","تَسْتَعْجِلُونِ"],"en":"Man was created of haste. I will show you My signs, so do not impatiently urge Me"}},{"ar":"عَجُول","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"hasty","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":11,"p":8,"ar":["وَيَدْعُ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","بِٱلشَّرِّ","دُعَآءَهُۥ","بِٱلْخَيْرِ ۖ","وَكَانَ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","عَجُولًا"],"en":"And man supplicates for evil as he supplicates for good, and man is ever hasty"}},{"ar":"تَعَجَّلَ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"to hurry","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":203,"p":7,"ar":["وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","فِىٓ","أَيَّامٍ","مَّعْدُودَٰتٍ ۚ","فَمَن","تَعَجَّلَ","فِى","يَوْمَيْنِ","فَلَآ","إِثْمَ","عَلَيْهِ","وَمَن","تَأَخَّرَ","فَلَآ","إِثْمَ","عَلَيْهِ ۚ","لِمَنِ","ٱتَّقَىٰ ۗ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّكُمْ","إِلَيْهِ","تُحْشَرُونَ"],"en":"And remember Allah during [specific] numbered days. Then whoever hastens [his departure] in two days - there is no sin upon him; and whoever delays [until the third] - there is no sin upon him - for him who fears Allah. And fear Allah and know that unto Him you will be gathered"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتِعْجَال","kind":"verbal noun","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"seeking to hasten","word":null,"ex":{"s":10,"a":11,"p":6,"ar":["وَلَوْ","يُعَجِّلُ","ٱللَّهُ","لِلنَّاسِ","ٱلشَّرَّ","ٱسْتِعْجَالَهُم","بِٱلْخَيْرِ","لَقُضِىَ","إِلَيْهِمْ","أَجَلُهُمْ ۖ","فَنَذَرُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَرْجُونَ","لِقَآءَنَا","فِى","طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ","يَعْمَهُونَ"],"en":"And if Allah was to hasten for the people the evil [they invoke] as He hastens for them the good, their term would have been ended for them. But We leave the ones who do not expect the meeting with Us, in their transgression, wandering blindly"}}],"surahs":[[2,5],[10,4],[20,4],[7,3],[17,3],[51,3],[6,2],[21,2],[27,2],[29,2],[46,2],[75,2],[4,1],[11,1],[13,1],[16,1],[18,1],[19,1],[22,1],[26,1],[37,1],[38,1],[42,1],[48,1],[76,1]]}